  "title": "Malaysia delays B2B e-invoicing to August 2024",
  "summary": "Malaysia has announced a two month delay for the adoption of B2B e-invoicing. Taxpayers with annual turnover of MYR 100 or above must comply with e-invoicing from Aug 1st, 2024",
